Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:41.30,H_en,,0,0,0,,"I have a SYSTEM." Nobody believes him... yet.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:41.30,C_en,,0,0,0,,Watch ALL episodes FREE ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:00.99,S_en,,0,0,0,,I have a SYSTEM.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.10,0:00:03.00,S_en,,0,0,0,,A system?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.04,0:00:04.62,S_en,,0,0,0,,A secret military system made abroad,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.66,0:00:05.74,S_en,,0,0,0,,or one you built yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.78,0:00:06.68,S_en,,0,0,0,,that foreign powers are eyeing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.72,0:00:07.62,S_en,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.66,0:00:08.56,S_en,,0,0,0,,A SYSTEM system.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.60,0:00:09.50,S_en,,0,0,0,,Like the ones in web novels —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.54,0:00:10.86,S_en,,0,0,0,,check in and get supercars and mansions,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.90,0:00:11.80,S_en,,0,0,0,,skill points,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.84,0:00:13.46,S_en,,0,0,0,,the kind that turns you into a superhuman.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.50,0:00:17.08,S_en,,0,0,0,,Why are you laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.76,0:00:19.92,S_en,,0,0,0,,I'm a trained professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.96,0:00:21.36,S_en,,0,0,0,,No matter how funny, I won't laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.96,0:00:22.86,S_en,,0,0,0,,So what you're saying is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.90,0:00:23.84,S_en,,0,0,0,,you have a system like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.88,0:00:24.78,S_en,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.82,0:00:25.72,S_en,,0,0,0,,It appeared suddenly last month.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.76,0:00:26.72,S_en,,0,0,0,,But it seems buggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.76,0:00:27.84,S_en,,0,0,0,,Lots of garbled text.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.88,0:00:29.28,S_en,,0,0,0,,The missions it gives are bizarre.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.32,0:00:31.00,S_en,,0,0,0,,Finished missions earn all kinds of rewards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.08,0:00:32.20,S_en,,0,0,0,,The first few boosted my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.24,0:00:33.28,S_en,,0,0,0,,I can't prove any of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.32,0:00:34.24,S_en,,0,0,0,,And if you fail a mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:35.18,S_en,,0,0,0,,Fail...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.22,0:00:36.56,S_en,,0,0,0,,it kills me and my whole family.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.01,0:00:39.49,S_en,,0,0,0,,Persecution delusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.53,0:00:40.43,S_en,,0,0,0,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.47,0:00:41.30,S_en,,0,0,0,,Let him calm down first.
